        "source": "mlx-gen-mage/src/quant.rs and candle-gen-mage/src/quant.rs `COMPONENT_PRECISION_FLOORS`; both final-head load seams resolve through that descriptor-visible q4 → q8 declaration. The MLX measurement records 18.9 MB at Q8 against 10.6 MB at Q4; the manifest footprints record the 0.009 GB delta."
